- CTA Effectiveness
- Trust Signals
- Visual Hierarchy
- Mobile Experience
- Content & Copy
- Page Performance

### Scan Pipeline (analyze-url Edge Function)

**15 Steps:**
1. Auth verification (Bearer JWT)
2. Request parsing (url, page_type, existingScanId)
3. Scan limit check (`increment_scan_usage` RPC)
4. Scan record creation/update (status="analyzing")
5. Screenshot + DOM scrape (Railway service)
6. Screenshot upload to Storage
7. AI Vision Analysis (Claude Vision API)
8. AI Text Analysis (Claude text model)
9. PageSpeed Analysis (Google API)
10. Score calculation (weighted by page type)
11. **scan_results insertion** (7 rows, one per pillar)
12. Scan status update (mark "completed")
13. Email notification (fire-and-forget)
14. Return scan_id + overall_score

