### RLS Security Pattern

All new tables in Sprint 2/3 should use:
```sql
CREATE POLICY "table_select_own"
  ON public.table FOR SELECT
  USING (
    EXISTS (
      SELECT 1 FROM public.scans
      WHERE scans.id = table.scan_id
        AND scans.user_id = auth.uid()
    )
  );
```

